# Hard-Won Jitte {1}{R}, Equip {2}: "Equipped creature has double strike." One mana is short of the equip cost (refused); two
# pay it exactly. The equipped Memnite (1/1) hits Bot2 for 1 in each damage step, 2 in all; the unequipped Ornithopter has no
# keyword but flying. Moving the Jitte to the Ornithopter takes the double strike off the Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Hard-Won Jitte
Ornithopter
Mountain
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

